                    "`seed`/`output_format`/`image_base64`/`strength`), upscale_fast (`image_base64`, optional "
                    "`output_format`), upscale_conservative (`image_base64`+`prompt`, optional `negative_prompt`/"
                    "`creativity`/`seed`/`output_format`), upscale_creative (`image_base64`+`prompt`, optional "
                    "`negative_prompt`/`creativity`/`seed`/`output_format`/`style_preset`), edit_inpaint "
