                    "`creativity`/`seed`/`output_format`), edit_erase (`image_base64`, optional `mask_base64`/"
                    "`grow_mask`/`seed`/`output_format`), edit_remove_background (`image_base64`, optional "
                    "`output_format`), edit_search_and_replace (`image_base64`+`prompt`+`search_prompt`, optional "
                    "`negative_prompt`/`grow_mask`/`seed`/`output_format`), control_sketch (`image_base64`+`prompt`, "
                    "optional `control_strength`/`negative_prompt`/`seed`/`output_format`/`style_preset`), "
